  "plugins": [
    {
      "name": "@local/qq-bot",
      "title": "QQ 机器人通道",
      "description": {
        "en": "Zero-download QQ bot channel plugin for DeepSeek Harness. Pure Node with no npm dependencies or installs, it provides an in-panel direct-chat test that runs the full BotLogic pipeline immediately with no QQ client and no API key (Harness-native model by default), optionally connects out to an already-running OneBot v11 forward WebSocket or accepts reverse WebSocket / HTTP POST from any existing OneBot implementation, receives images and answers questions, and keeps per-session long-term memory.",
        "zh": "零下载的 DeepSeek Harness QQ 机器人通道插件：纯 Node、无 npm 依赖、不下载不安装任何 QQ 客户端，启用后即可在面板「① 直聊测试」里直接走完整的收图、模型作答、记忆与分段回复流程（无需 QQ 客户端、无需密钥，默认跟随 Harness 原生模型）；如需连接真实 QQ，可选填一个已经装好并正在运行的 OneBot v11 正向 WebSocket 地址，或让任意已有 OneBot 实现以反向 WebSocket / HTTP POST 连回本插件；支持接收图片答题与按会话隔离的长期记忆。"
      },
